  "description": "Seo Yuna, a team leader at an advertising agency and a dominant omega, has been living a controlled life, disguising herself as a 'beta' by taking harsh suppressants to protect her career. One day, a new employee named Kwon Lee-hyun (a supreme alpha) joins the team. Yuna senses his overwhelming pheromones and the instinctual aura of a predator, keeping her on edge. Lee-hyun begins to approach her, as if trying to uncover the true scent hidden beneath her suppressants.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587013964), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14351505), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/team_suppress), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000079539)",
